# WeatherGPT 🌦️

WeatherGPT is a conversational weather application designed to provide users with quick and easy access to weather information.

## 🚀 Features

- 🌡️ Temperature information
- 💧 Humidity information
- 🌤️ Weather conditions
- 🚨 Weather alerts
- 📍 Location-based weather search
- 🎤 Voice input support
- 🗣️ Hindi and English interaction
- 💬 Conversational weather interface
- 📱 Simple and user-friendly interface

## 🎯 Project Objective

The main objective of WeatherGPT is to make weather information easily accessible through a simple conversational interface.

It can help users get weather information quickly for daily activities, farming, research, and weather-related decision making.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Python
- FastAPI
- Uvicorn

### Weather Data
- Open-Meteo API

