⚙️ How to Run
1. Clone the Repository
git clone https://github.com/shubhanshiawasthi4-debug/WeatherGPT.git
2. Open the Project
Open the WeatherGPT folder in VS Code.
3. Install Dependencies
Open the terminal inside the weather_backend folder and run:
pip install -r requirements.txt
4. Start the Backend
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
5. Run the Frontend
Open:
weather_frontend/index.html
in a web browser.
🌐 Weather Data Source
Weather data is obtained using the Open-Meteo API.
